 ## Feature Freeze
 Mit v1.1.0 ist der geplante Funktionsumfang vorerst abgeschlossen. Weitere Releases sollen sich primär auf Fehlerbehebungen, Seitenkompatibilität und Stabilität konzentrieren.
+
+---
+
+## Online Library (v1.2.1)
+
+The **Online Library** lets you keep a large collection without storing every chapter on disk.
+
+When you click **☁ Merken** on an opened series, Manhwa Watcher stores only lightweight metadata such as the title, cover URL, source, series URL, language/status and your last-read chapter. No CBZ files are created.
+
+Open **Online-Bibliothek** from the header to search all saved titles across all sources. Opening a saved title loads its current chapter list live from the source. Use **Lesen** next to a chapter to open the source reader in Manhwa Watcher's integrated Chromium browser without downloading that chapter.
+
+The last chapter opened through **Lesen** is remembered and can be reopened with **Weiterlesen**. v1.2.1 re-resolves the selected chapter before opening it and blocks unexpected redirects to unrelated titles.
+
+Offline CBZ downloads remain available independently, so you can mix both workflows:
+
+```text
+Online Library -> thousands of lightweight saved titles
+CBZ Library    -> selected series/chapters you want offline
+```
+
+Online Library entries are included in backup/restore.
+
+
+## Read status
+
+Online Library chapters are marked with `✓ GELESEN` after you open them in the online reader. The status can be reset without deleting the title or any downloads.
